            "height": 0.10690909090909065
          },
          "block_content": "    \\mathcal{P}_{12} &= 1-\\mathcal{D}_{131}-\\mathcal{D}_{13121}+\\mathcal{D}_{1213131},\\\\\n    \\mathcal{P}_{23} &= 0,\\\\\n    \\mathcal{P}_{31} &= -\\mathcal{D}_{13}+\\mathcal{D}_{1213}+\\mathcal{D}_{121313}-\\mathcal{D}_{13121213},\\\\\n    \\mathcal{P}_{21} &= \\mathcal{D}_{12}-\\mathcal{D}_{1312}-\\mathcal{D}_{131212}+\\mathcal{D}_{12131312},\\\\\n    \\mathcal{P}_{32} &= 0,\\\\\n    \\mathcal{P}_{13} &= -1 + \\mathcal{D}_{121}+\\mathcal{D}_{12131}-\\mathcal{D}_{1312121}.",
          "label": "Formula"
